{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33151","headline":"长安逢隐者 · 于武陵","name":"长安逢隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征车千里至，碾遍六街尘。\n向此有营地，忽逢无事人。\n昔时颜未改，浮世路多新。\n且脱衣沽酒，终南山欲春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}